Story: Watching two computer teams play
  As a developer of a commander
  I want to watch two computer commanders play a game with real ArduPilot drones
  So that I have a baseline for my own commander

  The game server starts ten ArduPlane SITL drones, and it plays a whole game with a computer
  commander for each team. At the end, its report tells you how the drones flew and what each
  team took.

  Scenario: Play and watch
    When two computer teams play a game of Towers
    Then the drones in AGENT mode are 10
    And the commands that the drones refused are 0
    And the towers that the two teams took are at least 1
    And the sightings from the fog on the Blue seat are 0
    And the Red drones that the Blue seat saw are at least 1
    And the drones that crashed are 0
